Parsing config file for zone 0

----------------- Physical Case Definition ( Zone 0 ) -------------------
Compressible Euler equations.
Mach number: 0.1.
Angle of attack (AoA): 0 deg, and angle of sideslip (AoS): 0 deg.
No restart solution, use the values at infinity (freestream).
Dimensional simulation.
The reference area is 1 m^2.
The semi-span will be computed using the max y(3D) value.
The reference length is 1 m.
Input mesh file name: mesh.su2

--------------- Space Numerical Integration ( Zone 0 ) ------------------
Discontinuous Galerkin Finite element solver
Roe (with entropy fix) solver for inviscid fluxes over the faces
Quadrature factor for elements with constant Jacobian:     2
Quadrature factor for elements with non-constant Jacobian: 3
Byte alignment matrix multiplications:      128
Padded matrix size for optimal performance: 16

--------------- Time Numerical Integration  ( Zone 0 ) ------------------
Local time stepping (steady state simulation).
Runge-Kutta explicit method for the flow equations.
Number of steps: 1
Alpha coefficients: 	1
No CFL adaptation.
Courant-Friedrichs-Lewy number:      0.1

------------------ Convergence Criteria  ( Zone 0 ) ---------------------
Maximum number of solver subiterations: 2.
Begin convergence monitoring at iteration 5.
Residual minimum value: 1e-14.
Cauchy series min. value: 1e-10.
Number of Cauchy elements: 100.
Begin windowed time average at iteration 0.

-------------------- Output Information ( Zone 0 ) ----------------------
Writing the convergence history file every 1 inner iterations.
Writing the screen convergence history every 1 inner iterations.
The tabular file format is CSV (.csv).
Convergence history file name: history.
Forces breakdown file name: forces_breakdown.dat.
Surface file name: surface.
Volume file name: vol_solution.
Restart file name: restart.

