------------------- Geometry Preprocessing ( Zone 0 ) -------------------
Three dimensional problem.
27 grid points.
8 volume elements.
6 surface markers.
Creating standard volume elements.
Creating face information.
Computing metric terms volume elements.
Computing metric terms surface elements.
Computing length scale volume elements.
Computing coordinates of the integration points.
Computing coordinates of the solution DOFs.
Preprocessing for the wall functions. 
Storing a mapping from global to local DOF index.
Area projection in the z-plane = 0.
Computing wall distances.

-------------------- Solver Preprocessing ( Zone 0 ) --------------------
Inviscid flow: Computing density based on free-stream
temperature and pressure using the ideal gas law.
Force coefficients computed using free-stream values.

